// endpoint_withdraw_workspace_close.proto — WithdrawWorkspaceClose: take back
// a workspace's standing close request (CloseWorkspaceRequest.stand), so the
// daemon no longer closes it once its blockers clear. Asked by the workspace's
// own agent (`agent-repld workspace close here -cancel`), by the user, or by
// another workspace's agent on the user's behalf. Any prompt the user sends
// the workspace withdraws the request too, without this call: a workspace the
// user works with again is never closed under them.

